        "created_at": "2017-04-27T14:44:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I guess I’m in the minority then, I love playing against the vengeful 5. In fact I’ve played 50 regular vengeance games and 50 advanced games in the video game alone… that’s by far the more of any solo villain in the game.</p>\n<p>Villains is great as well, but feels more like a bunch of separate fights than 1 big fight; still, it adds a ton of replay value to the format.</p>\n<p>I’m not going to disagree that more solo villains is for me a huge reason to buy SoEP…that’s probably what I’m looking forward to most actually.</p>",
