        "id": 194272,
        "name": "MrLeRobot",
        "username": "MrLeRobot",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mrlerobot/{size}/1932_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-27T19:58:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>One of my favorite \"on-the-side\" things to do is a 2v2 game - two heroes vs two Vengeance/VotM villains. Quick, brutal, and works pretty darn well! Synergies are important enough that 1v1s aren't really that fun, but then, I'm not much of a solo gamer. YMMV.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I can vouch for that. It works surprisingly well!</p>",
